                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of purebred ancestry."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d8eecfc-b70e-413b-8a4f-ec4da07e7cd2",
                                                "sense_id": "04e41517-97e2-32c1-a19d-20ec7983fd86",
                                                "text": "Blood quantum rules — which began as a colonizer practice designed to limit tribal citizenship but were later adopted by some Native peoples as a means of preserving cultural identity — require the tribe’s members to be at least one-eighth S’Klallam and to have at least one full-blooded S’Klallam ancestor."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5db30d2d-07f8-373c-b5ad-5af3e69a89ef",
                                        "entry_id": "32ca15b3-0957-331b-9663-26d46bc80d59",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having a florid or ruddy complexion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f08f90a1-1429-3535-b8d5-5171a0e17afb",
                                        "entry_id": "32ca15b3-0957-331b-9663-26d46bc80d59",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Hearty or lusty."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a313569f-167b-4931-8024-15c73b9f9de2",
                                                "sense_id": "f08f90a1-1429-3535-b8d5-5171a0e17afb",
                                                "text": "And when it was quickly returned to Jarvis, with United failing to mark properly, his clean cross was met with a full-blooded header by former Colchester defender Elokobi, who had to stretch his neck back to add power."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "26a1148f-d827-452e-94e2-2678763cbf8f",
                        "source_entry_id": "662f2c73-baf5-39cb-8b27-827deeca7540",
                        "target_lang_word": "pur-sang",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pur-sang",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "719eed0c-fd81-3e44-afe8-13b804995623",
                                        "entry_id": "c9d5ed0c-0a28-3a30-8649-4af0d914d794",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Cheval de selle de race pure originaire du désert arabique."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Hippologie"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "72ffa980-53e4-44a8-a662-01f8e5d9456b",
                                                "sense_id": "719eed0c-fd81-3e44-afe8-13b804995623",
                                                "text": "On ne présente plus le pur-sang arabe. Sa beauté, son charisme et toutes les légendes qui s’y rattachent en font un cheval à part. Sur le plan hippotechnique, c’est aussi le plus grand améliorateur de toutes les races, avec le pur-sang anglais… […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "04a73346-c05b-3af1-8e87-139e374070b9",
                                        "entry_id": "c9d5ed0c-0a28-3a30-8649-4af0d914d794",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Race anglaise de chevaux, obtenue par croisement avec cette race, synonyme de pur-sang anglais."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af7aa167-dd20-4a95-aa49-59771892ca1f",
                                                "sense_id": "04a73346-c05b-3af1-8e87-139e374070b9",
                                                "text": "Au XVIIIᵉ siècle, quelques étalons arabes ont été importés et croisés avec des juments anglaises. Les produits de ces croisements ont donné les pur-sangs anglais."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "pur-sang",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4d85f82f-61d5-3824-9f94-118c4df27bb3",
                                        "entry_id": "1e2eb40c-6b0d-302d-9f05-ad5979e09c2b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Appartenant à la race équine des purs-sangs."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03038dcd-edc4-4ffa-9509-01c6647ed4dd",
                                                "sense_id": "4d85f82f-61d5-3824-9f94-118c4df27bb3",
                                                "text": "Un cheval, une pouliche pur-sang."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "96f162c4-97e1-4255-bfd2-f6db3c77333b",
                                                "sense_id": "4d85f82f-61d5-3824-9f94-118c4df27bb3",
                                                "text": "Le printemps est là. L’agneau bondit près de sa mère et le poulain pur-sang près de la jument pur-sane."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dbd821ec-33c2-3991-8445-abf7f21ac2c2",
                                        "entry_id": "1e2eb40c-6b0d-302d-9f05-ad5979e09c2b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "De race pure, non mêlée."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "856c2a14-e821-4139-919e-e5c0ff15d78f",
                                                "sense_id": "dbd821ec-33c2-3991-8445-abf7f21ac2c2",
                                                "text": "Cette Vénitienne pur-sang avait douze ans quand Capraja s’y intéressa, et vingt-six ans quand il mourut."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9e09a974-da59-45f7-8e2c-74a3cd4b5c6d",
                                                "sense_id": "dbd821ec-33c2-3991-8445-abf7f21ac2c2",
                                                "text": "Bien qu'il fût Islandais pur sang , il semblait supporter difficilement le climat de son pays : il était affligé d'une toux opiniâtre."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
